Type: Package
Package: ipcr
Title: Individual Parameter Contribution Regression
Version: 0.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Manuel", "Arnold", , "manuel.arnold@hu-berlin.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Julien Patrick", "Irmer", , "irmer@psychologie.uni-freiburg.de", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides methods for explaining and predicting individual and
    group differences in model parameters using individual parameter
    contribution regression (IPCR). The package is primarily designed for
    structural equation models fitted with the OpenMx and lavaan packages,
    but also supports lmer and glmer models from lme4, as well as lm and
    glm models from the stats package.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/manuelarnold/ipcr
